cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DC-SST — Dispensing-Counter Stewardship Support Tool"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A counter-level tool for retail pharmacies in Nepal that identifies whether a
  dispensed product is an antibiotic, assigns its WHO AWaRe group, and records the
  encounter as the measurement instrument for a stepped-wedge implementation study
  of antibiotic stewardship at the pharmacy counter.
authors:
  - name: "Youth for World Nepal"
  - name: "Sncho Health"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/ywn-kathmandu/counter-amr-dcsst/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ywn-kathmandu/counter-amr-dcsst"
version: 0.10.0-prototype
date-released: "2026-10-12"
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - antibiotic stewardship
  - WHO AWaRe
  - retail pharmacy
  - implementation research
  - Nepal
